From: Jyri Sarha <jsarha-l0cyMroinI0@public.gmane.org>
Subject: [PATCH RFC v3 6/7] drm/i2c: tda998x: Register ASoC HDMI codec for audio functionality
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2015 12:30:44 +0300
Message-ID: <1e8e3215caa932dab68de8576aee81f5e1008163.1439542916.git.jsarha@ti.com>
References: <cover.1439542916.git.jsarha@ti.com>
